HB0146 Animal estray penalty-amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Neiman, Allemand, Banks, Davis,
Hoeft and Williams and Senator(s) Crago and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to agriculture, livestock and other animals; imposing a minimum
fine and increasing the maximum fine for the penalty for taking up estray
animals; providing increased penalties for second and subsequent offenses;
making a conforming amendment; specifying applicability; and providing for an
effective date.
1/10/2025 Bill Number Assigned
1/13/2025 H Received for Introduction
2/3/2025 H Did not Consider for Introduction